    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000t9r5](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000t9r5) Magnitude 6.2 earthquake at 120.932 depth occurred on Jul 03 2026 33km W of Danau. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 1.8205 longitude 127.4916. It impacted 101523 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
